# Black Tiger Skins (sandoria 31): Hanaa Punaa in Southern San d'Oria. The guard (fame level 3 and Lizard Skins
# completed): a trade while available (nothing), the guard false on Lizard Skins' side (its 559) and on the fame side
# (Lizard Skins' 591), the offer 576 declined (Prog 1), 579 declined and taken, the accepted 578, the wrong trades, 577
# for exactly three Tiger Hides (completed: Tiger Stole, fame +30, Cat Skinner; the hides taken), the completed 592 at
# fame level 3, a trade once completed (nothing), and below fame level 3 Lizard Skins' 591 instead of 592.
# Hanaa Punaa has no script and no default event; The Seamstress and Lizard Skins also name her (The Seamstress is
# completed here, so its completed trade handler answers nil to each trade).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Hanaa_Punaa/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Hanaa_Punaa/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/576 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/579 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/577
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-178.2,-8.8,27.6
fame Sandoria 125
quest Sandoria.TheSeamstress completed
item TigerHide x6
item BoneChip
login
trade Hanaa_Punaa TigerHide x3            # available: no handler answers, nothing
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # Lizard Skins not completed: Lizard Skins' 559
finish option=1                           # Lizard Skins: its Prog 1
quest Sandoria.LizardSkins completed
fame Sandoria 124
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # Lizard Skins completed, fame level 2: Lizard Skins' 591
finish
fame Sandoria 125
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # fame level 3: 576
finish option=1                           # not option 0: Prog 1
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # Prog 1: 579
finish option=1                           # not option 0: nothing
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # 579
finish                                    # option 0: begun
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # accepted: 578
finish
trade Hanaa_Punaa BoneChip x1             # nil
trade Hanaa_Punaa TigerHide x2            # two: nil
trade Hanaa_Punaa TigerHide x3 BoneChip x1   # not exactly three: nil
trade Hanaa_Punaa TigerHide x3            # exactly three: 577
finish                                    # completed: Tiger Stole, fame +30 (155), Cat Skinner, the hides taken
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # completed, fame level 3: 592
finish
trade Hanaa_Punaa TigerHide x3            # completed: no trade handler of this quest, nothing
fame Sandoria 124
trigger Hanaa_Punaa                       # completed, fame level 2: no 592; Lizard Skins' 591
finish
